  * See hw-report.md: volume-up is PM6150L SID 4, NOT PM6150 SID 0.
  * PMIC access is READ ONLY: the sole MMIO write issues EXT_READL on an
  * observer channel. No PMIC config, IRQ acknowledge or reset writes exist.
+ *
+ * Boards (device tree root compatible):
+ *   xiaomi,sweet       SPMI arbiter v5, PM6150 PON + PM6150L GPIO 4
+ *   nothing,asteroids  SPMI arbiter v7, PMK8550 PON + PMXR2230 GPIO 6, and the
+ *                      AI key on TLMM GPIO 71 as Home (asteroids probe 7)
+ * The v7 register layout (APID map at core + 0x2000, owner table at cnfg,
+ * observer channel stride 0x20) is documented by Linux
+ * drivers/spmi/spmi-pmic-arb.c; addresses, PPIDs and bits come from the
+ * phones' device trees.
  */
